      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should talk to someone but it feels so useless. like i am just talkin in circles. there is no \"getting through\" this when the thing i spent my whole adult life on is just dead. it feels like i am just bankrupt in every way. it feels like the ledger is just at zero and there is no way to get back to even. i'm just tired of trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken.\nbalance is impossible now.  lmk what u think. ika why bother",
