      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so irrational to keep going. like, why would i start a new ledger when the cost of living is just more debt? i've put everything i had into this one thing and it failed. the math doesn't work anymore. it feels like the only logical response to a total loss is to just stop playing. like, once you realize the game is rigged and you've already lost everything, why stay at the table?\n volare tell point of it.",
